<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<gpx version="1.1" creator="book_route.py" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1">
<metadata><name>Coffin Mountain from Highway 22 by Roads 11 and 1168 and the lookout trail</name><desc>or-vielbig-2e:233-1: route read from the book's text and sketch map. One trkseg per waypoint pair, in order; segment sources are in the trk desc. Geometry from OSM (ODbL, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors) and USFS EDW (public domain) where marked; 'straight' segments are off-trail connectors, not traced.</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="44.582930" lon="-121.982423"><ele>819.2</ele><name>Highway 22 at Road 11</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin th:hwy22-road-11 (OSM node 40344359); confidence: high; pdf_page: 235; book_elev_ft: 3208; quote: turn west onto Road 11 (3,208 feet), a paved, two-lane road</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.581011" lon="-122.037926"><ele>1209.6</ele><name>Road 11 / Road 1168 junction</name><desc>source: USFS EDW 1100000 meets 1168000 (shared vertex); DEM 3,969 ft; confidence: high; pdf_page: 235; book_elev_ft: 4000; quote: for 4.1 miles to Road 1168 (4,000 feet), a gravel road</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.591730" lon="-122.037000"><ele>1370.3</ele><name>First saddle</name><desc>source: 1.71 mi up EDW 1168000, where the road turns west after its northward climb; DEM 4,496 ft; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 235; quote: Road 1168 climbs through clearcuts and second growth 1.7 miles to an open saddle</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.604130" lon="-122.040950"><ele>1493.8</ele><name>High point, wide road bend (4,900 ft)</name><desc>source: 3.20 mi up EDW 1168000 (1.49 mi past the first saddle), the road's local high point; DEM 4,901 ft, 1.2 mi SSE of the summit; confidence: high; pdf_page: 235; book_elev_ft: 4900; quote: Ski west from the saddle to a second saddle and continue, now eastward, to a wide bend on an open, clearcut ridge, the high point of the tour at 4,900 feet and 1.5 miles from the first saddle. This high point is 7.3 miles from Highway 22.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.608350" lon="-122.049865"><ele>1443.7</ele><name>Saddle at the foot of the lookout ridge (Coffin Mountain Trailhead)</name><desc>source: OSM: start of way 313639665 Coffin Lookout Trail, by the Coffin Mountain Trailhead parking (way 701984522), on Road 1168 west of the bend; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 235; quote: ski 0.9 mile on a gentle descent across open, steep hillsides to the saddle at the foot of the final, bare ridge to the fire lookout</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.621428" lon="-122.044423"><ele>1761.4</ele><name>Coffin Mountain lookout</name><desc>source: OSM: end of Coffin Lookout Trail at the lookout (way 313639697); GNIS-style peak node 357308190 is 40 m away; confidence: high; pdf_page: 235; book_elev_ft: 5771; quote: Here the summer trail climbs 1,600 feet on south-facing open slopes to the final, almost-level forested ridge to the lookout.</desc></wpt>
<trk><name>Coffin Mountain from Highway 22 by Roads 11 and 1168 and the lookout trail</name><desc>1. Highway 22 at Road 11 -&gt; Road 11 / Road 1168 junction: usfs-road (high), 4.18 mi | 2. Road 11 / Road 1168 junction -&gt; First saddle: usfs-road (high), 1.71 mi | 3. First saddle -&gt; High point, wide road bend (4,900 ft): usfs-road (high), 1.50 mi | 4. High point, wide road bend (4,900 ft) -&gt; Saddle at the foot of the lookout ridge (Coffin Mountain Trailhead): usfs-road (high), 0.69 mi | 5. Saddle at the foot of the lookout ridge (Coffin Mountain Trailhead) -&gt; Coffin Mountain lookout: osm (medium), 1.33 mi</desc>
